{"c":[{"name":"20261023T194315Z-636df94295e2a95b","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: explain a migration cutoff by the mechanism. A step can need a dependency the engine will not load, or the result can be something SQL cannot make. Say that before the branch. Do not use schema version numbers.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T194731Z-18fb669bc11e2a93","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: after a diagram, walk each branch and say why before the mechanics. Repeat the noun. Do not use 'that step' or 'it' for something named earlier.","type":"note"}]}
